---
import InteractiveFrame from "./InteractiveFrame.astro";
import { scenarios } from "./temporal-model";
const first = scenarios.success[0];
---

<InteractiveFrame
  id="temporal-flow"
  title="한 요청이 완료되기까지"
  description="경로를 따라가며 서비스와 워커의 역할을 구분해 보세요."
  caption="개념을 설명하기 위한 시뮬레이션입니다. 실제 Temporal 서버에 연결하지 않으며, 태스크 큐와 응답 왕복을 간략히 표현했습니다."
>
  <temporal-flow>
    <div class="flow-toolbar" hidden data-controls>
      <div class="scenario-buttons" role="group" aria-label="실행 시나리오">
        <button type="button" data-scenario="success" aria-pressed="true"
          >정상 실행</button
        >
        <button type="button" data-scenario="retry" aria-pressed="false"
          >실패 후 재시도</button
        >
      </div>
      <span class="flow-state" data-status>실행 전</span>
    </div>

    <div class="flow-workspace">
      <div class="flow-visual">
        <div
          class="graph-scroll"
          tabindex="0"
          role="region"
          aria-label="Temporal 구성도. 좁은 화면에서는 좌우로 스크롤할 수 있습니다."
        >
          <svg
            viewBox="0 0 720 400"
            class="flow-graph"
            role="img"
            aria-labelledby="temporal-svg-title temporal-svg-description"
          >
            <title id="temporal-svg-title">
              Temporal의 서비스와 두 종류의 워커
            </title>
            <desc id="temporal-svg-description"
              >클라이언트는 서비스에 요청합니다. 서비스는 워크플로 워커와
              액티비티 워커에 태스크를 전달하고 실행 히스토리를 보관합니다.</desc
            >
            <defs>
              <marker
                id="temporal-arrow"
                markerWidth="7"
                markerHeight="7"
                refX="6"
                refY="3.5"
                orient="auto"
                ><path d="M0 0 L7 3.5 L0 7" fill="context-stroke"
                ></path></marker
              >
            </defs>
            <rect
              class="service-boundary"
              x="244"
              y="42"
              width="216"
              height="316"
              rx="16"></rect>
            <text class="boundary-label" x="266" y="72">Temporal 서비스</text>
            <g
              class="connections"
              fill="none"
              marker-end="url(#temporal-arrow)"
            >
              <path data-edge="start" d="M178 172 H264"></path>
              <path
                data-edge="workflow"
                d="M440 142 H482 Q496 142 496 128 V122 Q496 108 510 108 H552"
              ></path>
              <path
                data-edge="schedule"
                d="M552 151 H510 Q496 151 496 165 V186 Q496 200 482 200 H440"
              ></path>
              <path
                data-edge="activity"
                d="M440 226 H482 Q496 226 496 240 V263 Q496 277 510 277 H552"
              ></path>
              <path
                data-edge="result"
                d="M552 320 H486 Q472 320 472 306 V264 Q472 250 458 250 H440"
              ></path>
              <path class="internal-edge" d="M350 254 V273"></path>
            </g>
            <text class="edge-label" x="194" y="157">요청</text>
            <text class="edge-label" x="475" y="92">Workflow Task</text>
            <text class="edge-label" x="488" y="351">Activity Task / 결과</text>
            <g data-node="client" class="graph-node">
              <rect x="24" y="130" width="154" height="84" rx="10"></rect>
              <text class="node-name" x="44" y="163">클라이언트</text>
              <text class="node-detail" x="44" y="187">실행을 요청</text>
            </g>
            <g data-node="service" class="graph-node">
              <rect x="264" y="104" width="176" height="150" rx="10"></rect>
              <text class="node-name" x="284" y="139">태스크 관리</text>
              <text class="node-detail" x="284" y="166"
                >큐 · 타이머 · 재시도</text
              >
              <text class="node-caption" x="284" y="196"
                >다음 일을 전달합니다</text
              >
            </g>
            <g data-node="history" class="graph-node history-node">
              <rect x="264" y="275" width="176" height="63" rx="10"></rect>
              <text class="node-name" x="284" y="301">Event History</text>
              <text class="node-detail" x="284" y="323">실행 진행을 보관</text>
            </g>
            <g data-node="workflow" class="graph-node">
              <rect x="552" y="76" width="148" height="104" rx="10"></rect>
              <text class="node-name" x="570" y="108">워크플로 워커</text>
              <text class="node-detail" x="570" y="134">순서와 분기</text>
              <text class="node-caption" x="570" y="159"
                >워크플로 코드 실행</text
              >
            </g>
            <g data-node="activity" class="graph-node">
              <rect x="552" y="246" width="148" height="88" rx="10"></rect>
              <text class="node-name" x="570" y="276">액티비티 워커</text>
              <text class="node-detail" x="570" y="301">외부 작업 수행</text>
              <text class="node-caption" x="570" y="321">예: 이미지 변환</text>
            </g>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="graph-caption">
          <span><i></i>현재 경로</span><span
            >서비스가 기록하고, 워커가 실행합니다.</span
          >
        </div>
        <p class="mobile-graph-hint">
          구성도를 좌우로 움직여 전체를 볼 수 있습니다.
        </p>
      </div>
      <aside class="flow-explanation" aria-label="현재 단계 설명">
        <div class="step-meta">
          <span data-step-count>1 / 6</span><span data-attempt
            >액티비티 실행 전</span
          >
        </div>
        <p class="step-title" data-step-title>{first.title}</p>
        <p class="step-description" data-step-description>
          {first.description}
        </p>
        <div class="event-log">
          <span class="log-label">설명용 실행 기록</span>
          <ol data-event-log><li>{first.event}</li></ol>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
    <div class="playback" hidden data-controls>
      <div class="playback-actions">
        <button class="play-button" type="button" data-action="play"
          >재생</button
        >
        <button type="button" data-action="previous" aria-label="이전 단계"
          >이전</button
        >
        <button type="button" data-action="next" aria-label="다음 단계"
          >다음</button
        >
        <button type="button" data-action="reset">처음으로</button>
      </div>
      <label class="speed-label"
        >속도 <select aria-label="재생 속도" data-speed
          ><option value="0.5">0.5×</option><option value="1" selected
            >1×</option
          ><option value="2">2×</option></select
        ></label
      >
      <label class="seek-label"
        ><span class="sr-only">실행 단계</span><input
          data-seek
          type="range"
          min="0"
          max="5"
          value="0"
          step="1"
          aria-label="실행 단계"
        /></label
      >
      <div
        class="step-nav"
        role="group"
        aria-label="단계 바로가기"
        data-step-nav
      >
      </div>
      <p
        class="sr-only"
        aria-live="polite"
        aria-atomic="true"
        data-announcement
      >
      </p>
    </div>
    <noscript
      ><p class="no-script">
        JavaScript를 켜면 시나리오와 재생 기능을 사용할 수 있습니다. 아래
        본문에서 전체 흐름을 읽을 수 있습니다.
      </p></noscript
    >
  </temporal-flow>
</InteractiveFrame>

<script>
  import "./temporal-player";
</script>

<style>
  temporal-flow {
    display: block;
  }
  [hidden] {
    display: none !important;
  }
  button,
  select {
    font: inherit;
  }
  button {
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  button:disabled {
    opacity: 0.35;
    cursor: default;
  }
  .flow-toolbar {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1rem;
    padding: 1rem 1.75rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .scenario-buttons {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.25rem;
    background: var(--muted);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 4px;
  }
  .scenario-buttons button {
    min-height: 40px;
    border-radius: 5px;
    padding: 0.5rem 0.9rem;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
  }
  .scenario-buttons button[aria-pressed="true"] {
    background: var(--background);
    color: var(--foreground);
    box-shadow: 0 1px 3px color-mix(in srgb, var(--foreground) 10%, transparent);
  }
  .flow-state {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--accent);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .flow-workspace {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 300px;
  }
  .flow-visual {
    min-width: 0;
    align-self: center;
    padding: 1rem 0.5rem;
  }
  .graph-scroll {
    overflow-x: auto;
  }
  .flow-graph {
    width: 100%;
    min-width: 560px;
    height: auto;
  }
  .service-boundary {
    fill: color-mix(in srgb, var(--muted) 35%, var(--background));
    stroke: var(--border);
    stroke-dasharray: 4 5;
  }
  .boundary-label {
    fill: var(--muted-foreground);
    font-size: 14px;
  }
  .connections path {
    stroke: var(--muted-foreground);
    stroke-width: 1.5;
    opacity: 0.4;
  }
  .connections path[data-active="true"] {
    opacity: 1;
    stroke: var(--accent);
    stroke-width: 2.5;
    stroke-dasharray: 5 5;
  }
  temporal-flow[data-playing="true"] .connections path[data-active="true"] {
    animation: packet 1s linear infinite;
  }
  .connections .internal-edge {
    stroke-dasharray: 3 4;
  }
  .graph-node rect {
    fill: var(--background);
    stroke: var(--border);
    stroke-width: 1.5;
  }
  .graph-node[data-active="true"] rect {
    stroke: var(--accent);
    fill: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 7%, var(--background));
  }
  .node-name {
    fill: var(--foreground);
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 650;
  }
  .node-detail {
    fill: var(--muted-foreground);
    font-size: 13px;
  }
  .node-caption,
  .edge-label {
    fill: var(--muted-foreground);
    font-size: 11px;
  }
  .graph-caption {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin: 0.5rem 1.25rem;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
  }
  .graph-caption span:first-child {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .graph-caption i {
    width: 24px;
    border-top: 2px dashed var(--accent);
  }
  .mobile-graph-hint {
    display: none;
  }
  .flow-explanation {
    border-left: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding: 1.5rem;
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--muted) 30%, var(--background));
  }
  .step-meta {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
  }
  .step-meta span:first-child {
    color: var(--accent);
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }
  .step-title {
    margin: 1rem 0 0.65rem;
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    font-weight: 650;
    min-height: 3.8rem;
  }
  .step-description {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    min-height: 8.5rem;
    line-height: 1.9;
  }
  .event-log {
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
    padding-top: 1rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .log-label {
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
  }
  .event-log ol {
    margin: 0.6rem 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
    min-height: 4.8rem;
  }
  .event-log :global(li) {
    padding: 0.15rem 0;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
  }
  .event-log :global(li:last-child) {
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  .playback {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    padding: 1.25rem 1.75rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .playback-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.45rem;
  }
  .playback-actions button {
    min-height: 40px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 0.45rem 0.8rem;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
  }
  .playback-actions .play-button {
    background: var(--accent);
    color: var(--accent-foreground);
    border-color: var(--accent);
    min-width: 6rem;
    font-weight: 650;
  }
  .speed-label {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }
  select {
    padding: 0.3rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 5px;
    background: var(--background);
  }
  .seek-label {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
    display: flex;
  }
  input[type="range"] {
    accent-color: var(--accent);
    width: 100%;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .step-nav {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.4rem;
  }
  .step-nav :global(button) {
    cursor: pointer;
    min-height: 36px;
    font: inherit;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    padding: 0.35rem 0.55rem;
    border-radius: 5px;
    border: 1px solid transparent;
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
  }
  .step-nav :global(button[aria-current="step"]) {
    color: var(--accent);
    border-color: var(--border);
    background: var(--muted);
  }
  .no-script {
    padding: 1rem 1.75rem;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }
  @keyframes packet {
    to {
      stroke-dashoffset: -20;
    }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    temporal-flow[data-playing="true"] .connections path[data-active="true"] {
      animation: none;
    }
  }
  @media (max-width: 960px) {
    .flow-workspace {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .flow-explanation {
      border-left: 0;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 0.5rem 2rem;
    }
    .step-meta {
      grid-column: 1 / -1;
    }
    .step-title {
      grid-column: 1;
      margin: 0.5rem 0;
      min-height: 0;
    }
    .step-description {
      grid-column: 1;
      min-height: 0;
    }
    .event-log {
      grid-column: 2;
      grid-row: 2 / 4;
      margin: 0.5rem 0;
      border-top: 0;
      border-left: 1px solid var(--border);
      padding: 0 0 0 1.5rem;
    }
  }
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .flow-toolbar {
      padding: 0.8rem 1rem;
      gap: 0.4rem;
    }
    .scenario-buttons button {
      padding: 0.45rem 0.55rem;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
    }
    .flow-state {
      font-size: 0.7rem;
    }
    .flow-explanation {
      display: block;
      padding: 1.2rem;
    }
    .step-title {
      font-size: 1rem;
    }
    .step-description {
      min-height: 7rem;
    }
    .event-log {
      border: 0;
      padding: 1rem 0 0;
    }
    .event-log ol {
      min-height: 0;
    }
    .graph-caption {
      margin-inline: 0.6rem;
      font-size: 0.66rem;
    }
    .mobile-graph-hint {
      display: block;
      margin: 0.6rem 0.6rem 0;
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      color: var(--muted-foreground);
    }
    .playback {
      padding: 1rem;
      gap: 0.8rem;
    }
    .playback-actions {
      grid-column: 1 / -1;
    }
    .speed-label {
      grid-column: 1 / -1;
    }
  }
</style>
